"\n"
"■ Enhancing Relevance to Readers\n"
"\n"
"Clarify which areas your company leverages OSS most heavily in, citing concrete project names and examples.\n"
"\n"
"Phased approach example:\n"
" * Early stage: Survey internal engineers and list 3–5 daily-used OSS projects. Perfect coverage is unnecessary.\n"
" * Advanced stage: Use Software Composition Analysis (SCA) tools to visualize dependencies and map major OSS systematically.\n"
"\n"
"■ Direction of License Management\n"
"\n"
"Open source licenses carry legal terms and obligations.\n"
"However, the goal of license management is \"establishing an environment to leverage open source with confidence,\" not \"restriction.\"\n"
